WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:03.409
Shine light through two narrow slits…

00:03.429 --> 00:05.859
and bright and dark bands appear.

00:06.600 --> 00:08.785
Move the slits closer together.

00:08.970 --> 00:10.540
Do the bands squeeze in?

00:11.450 --> 00:13.709
No they spread APART.

00:13.729 --> 00:16.452
Fringe width is lambda D over d.

00:17.130 --> 00:20.678
Cover one slit… and the fringes vanish.

00:20.749 --> 00:23.894
Interference never creates or destroys light.

00:23.914 --> 00:26.047
It only moves it around.

00:26.755 --> 00:28.585
Make a single slit narrower…

00:28.605 --> 00:31.048
and the central band gets WIDER.

00:32.228 --> 00:34.781
Last cross two polaroids.

00:35.559 --> 00:36.745
Darkness.

00:37.533 --> 00:40.891
Slide a third one between them, at forty-five degrees…

00:40.911 --> 00:42.491
and light comes BACK!

00:42.511 --> 00:44.084
One eighth of it.

00:44.940 --> 00:49.800
LearnLoop AI. Predict. Watch. Explain.
